  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "今の取り消してください  (Please Take Back What You Just Said)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "client_f": "女性客",
    "kuroki": "黒木",
    "muranishi": "村西"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the dramatic finale of Episode Four, Kuroki warns Muranishi that his commercial compromise can never surpass their debut masterpiece—triggering an outburst that shatters their partnership.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "そんなくだらない理由で表現を変えるんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "こんなもので超えることなんかできません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "超えられるわけないだろ！何言ってんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どいつもこいつも同じこと言いやがって！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あんなものはな、何十も何百も奇跡が重なってたまたま撮れただけなんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あんなもん狙って撮れるわけないだろ！やるぞ、撮るぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "監督、お願いですから今の取り消してください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "撮影はベストを尽くす、全員。君もそうするんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いくぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "あなたの思ったとおりになりましたね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ダメだ、撮るんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "私じゃダメですか？黒木さんの代わり。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "そんなくだらない理由で表現を変えるんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You would change your artistic expression for such a shallow reason?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "こんなもので超えることなんかできません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With something like this, we can never surpass our debut hit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "超えられるわけないだろ！何言ってんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course nothing can surpass it! What are you talking about?!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "どいつもこいつも同じこと言いやがって！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every single person keeps saying the exact same thing!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あんなものはな、何十も何百も奇跡が重なってたまたま撮れただけなんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That film only happened by chance when dozens and hundreds of miracles piled up!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あんなもん狙って撮れるわけないだろ！やるぞ、撮るぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There's no way anyone could plan a shot like that! Let's do this—roll camera!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "監督、お願いですから今の取り消してください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director, I beg you—please take back what you just said.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "撮影はベストを尽くす、全員。君もそうするんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone gives their best on this shoot. You will do the same.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "いくぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's roll.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "あなたの思ったとおりになりましたね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It turned out just the way you expected, didn't it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ダメだ、撮るんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, we are shooting today.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "私じゃダメですか？黒木さんの代わり。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Would I not be good enough—in Ms. Kuroki's place?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
